@startuml
skinparam monochrome true
hide footbox
actor "Finance / Admin" as P0
participant "ProcurementView" as P1
participant "Store transisi PO" as P2
participant "Firestore" as P3
P0 -> P1: Pilih setuju atau tolak
P1 -> P2: persistPoTransition()
P2 -> P2: Baca klaim role
P2 -> P3: runTransaction dan get PO
P3 --> P2: Status PO terbaru
P2 -> P2: assertPoTransition()
P2 -> P3: Update Disetujui / Ditolak
P3 --> P2: Commit berhasil
P2 --> P1: Konfirmasi simpan
P1 --> P0: Status dan notifikasi
@enduml